example_output:
POST /users with Authorization header
→ 201 {"id": 1, "name": "Alice", "email": "alice@example.com"}
Log: User admin created new user: alice@example.com

GET /users/42 without authentication
→ 401 {"detail": "Not authenticated"}
Log: Token verification failed: credentials not provided

GET /users/99 from user trying to access others' data
→ 403 {"detail": "Cannot access other users' data"}
Log: Unauthorized access attempt: user1 -> 99
